==============================================================================
  RESULT — THE EVEN PART IS A RESUMMATION, NOT AN OPERATOR
==============================================================================

  PART 1. C8's admissible class is generated, not assumed. Take the bare response to
  the winding projection as LINEAR -- which is all C8's leading term asserts -- and let
  the medium back-react in proportion to the response it already carries. Self-
  consistency, F = F_0 - a F_0 F, has the fixed point

      F = F_0/(1 + a F_0) = u/(1 + a u),        c_w = -a exactly

  solved here by bisection rather than quoted (W-F). So the even part C8 demands is NOT
  a new operator to be added to the Lagrangian: it is what resumming the LINEAR
  coupling against the medium's back-reaction produces, and c_w IS the back-reaction
  strength. The ensemble band c_w in [-1.36, -0.32] becomes a band on that strength,
  a in [0.32, 1.36] -- order unity, which is what a medium not weakly coupled to its
  own response should give.

  IT ALSO EXPLAINS THE ODD-RESPONSE FAILURE STRUCTURALLY. tanh u and u/sqrt(1+u^2) are
  saturating forms imposed by hand, and neither is of resummed type -- fitting a at
  u = 0.5 leaves a 33% error by u = 1.5 (W-H). A back-reaction on a linear bare
  response always gives the rational form, so the c_w = 0 class was never a candidate
  the mechanism could have produced.

  AND IT PREDICTS RATHER THAN FITS. The geometric series fixes every higher coefficient
  from one number: c_3 = c_w^2, c_4 = -|c_w|^3 (W-G). The corpus currently carries the
  cubic with an ASSUMED unit coefficient, so nothing is being tuned to -- this is a
  forward statement. At the fit-implied c_w = -1.80 the predicted cubic is 3.24x larger
  than unit, and leading-order dominance still holds comfortably (W-J), so the
  mechanism does not collide with C9.

  WHAT IS STILL OWED. This supplies the FORM and the meaning of c_w; it does not supply
  the VALUE. Deriving a -- the medium's back-reaction strength on its own winding
  response -- is the remaining object, and it is now a single number in a named
  mechanism rather than an unspecified "response with an even part".

  PART 2 -- A BOOKING ERROR IN C9. Checking the numbers before using them (protocol 48)
  turned one up. The audit ledger computes C9's percentages from the winding moments,
  and the CUBIC reproduces exactly: eps^2 * <|cos|^3>/<|cos|> = eps^2 * (2/3) = 0.0105%
  as recorded (W-B). The QUADRATIC does not: eps * <cos^2>/<|cos|> = eps * (pi/4) =
  0.985%, against a recorded 0.83% -- an 18.7% discrepancy (W-C). The recorded figure is
  what you get by using 2/3, the CUBIC's moment ratio, in the quadratic's place:
  2/3 * eps = 0.836% (W-D).

  C9'S CONCLUSION IS UNAFFECTED. Both 0.83% and 0.985% are far below 1, so leading-order
  dominance holds either way (W-E). This is a booking correction, not a retraction --
  but the spec and the audit ledger both quote 0.83% as a computed result, and it is
  0.985%.

